          "settings": {
            "name": "Omar K.",
            "when": "JUL 2026",
            "ttl": "The halves lined up perfectly",
            "body": "Printed both halves flat-face-down on a Prusa MK4, no supports, glued them with CA and the seam basically disappeared after a light sand. The craters read properly even in PLA at 0.16 layer height.",
