            "ttl": "Actual relief, not a bump map",
            "body": "I have downloaded three moon models before this and all of them faked the surface with a texture. This one is modelled in. Scaled it to 180 mm for a resin print and the mare edges are still crisp.",
            "tags": "Verified buyer, Personal license, Elegoo Saturn"
          }
